NOTE ON SCOPE

This license covers the source code in this repository only.

It does NOT cover the compiled league data committed under `cpl/` and `_cpl/`.
That data (player names, team rosters, match results, and DUPR ratings) is
derived from the Cross Club League and DUPR and belongs to those third parties.
Nothing in this license grants any right to that data. See the "Data & privacy"
section of README.md.
